      "content": "i know you're supposed to say things like that to be helpful but it doesn't change the reality. some things just can't be fixed. i look in the mirror and i just see someone who's ruined everything. it feels like the world would actually be more peaceful if i just wasn't a part of it anymore. like, why am i even trying to stay when i'm just a net negative to everyone around me?",
